IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CHUNKED-PREFILL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CHUNK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 OVERLAP-PCT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CHUNKED-PREFILL.
    IF CHUNK-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    # chunks = SEQ-LEN / CHUNK-SIZE
    # denom = chunks + 1
    # OVERLAP-PCT = 100 - (100 / denom)
    MOVE SEQ-LEN TO R14.
    DIVIDE CHUNK-SIZE INTO R14.
    MOVE 1 TO R13.
    ADD R13 TO R14.

    MOVE 100 TO R13.
    DIVIDE R14 INTO R13.

    MOVE 100 TO OVERLAP-PCT.
    SUBTRACT R13 FROM OVERLAP-PCT.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 OVERLAP-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 CHUNK-SIZE.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
